; export-pdf.scr
; Export a vector PDF (-cpdf).
; Prompts: model space frame (Extents / Display) / export layouts (Yes / No) /
; export empty layouts (Yes / No, only when layouts=Yes) /
; text rendering (Text / Vector) / color mode (Color / Monochrome).
; Usage:
;   cad-simple-viewer-cli -i drawing.dwg -s examples/export-pdf.scr -o ./out
zoom
e
-cpdf
Extents
Yes
No
Text
Color
quit
